  "goodToKnow": "Kurbeln means to crank or wind: das Fenster herunterkurbeln, am Leierkasten kurbeln. Die Kurbel is a crank or handle. Very common figuratively is ankurbeln: die Wirtschaft, den Konsum ankurbeln (to boost). Old film cameras were hand-cranked, so einen Film kurbeln once meant to shoot a film. Regular: kurbelte, gekurbelt; ich kurble."
